@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Web
@namespace Cinnamon.Web.Pages
@page "/FAQ"

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <!-- Required meta tags -->
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">

    <!-- Bootstrap CSS -->
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.0.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet" integrity="sha384-EVSTQN3/azprG1Anm3QDgpJLIm9Nao0Yz1ztcQTwFspd3yD65VohhpuuCOmLASjC" crossorigin="anonymous">
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container p-5">
      <h1 style="text-align:center">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</h1>

      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-sm-12">
                <h2>Q.</h2><p text-align:justify>What is Cinnamon? </p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-sm-12" style="background-color:#ffa942">
            <h2>A.</h2><p>Cinnamon is a Family Experience Marketplace where you can book activities, learnings, and events for your kids and loved ones.</p>
        </div>
            <div class="col-sm-12">
                <h2>Q.</h2><p>Why the name Cinnamon?</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-sm-12" style="background-color:#ffa942">
                <h2>A.</h2><p text-align:justify>We love food that has cinnamon! It may not be an every day craving, but when we do want it,  we almost always know where to get. We find this similar to Family Experiences, trying out basketball, learning a new language, or biking with your child may not be an everyday thing but when you need to do it, you can go to Cinnamon to get it. </p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-sm-12">
                <h2>Q.</h2><p>How do I book an experience?</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-sm-12" style="background-color:#ffa942">
                <h2>A.</h2><p text-align:justify>It’s super easy! Select the experience you and your loved ones want to enjoy, read some details and when you’re ready, click BOOK, process payment, then just simply show up!</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-sm-12">
                <h2>Q.</h2><p>I’ve booked an experience. What’s next?</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-sm-12" style="background-color:#ffa942">
                <h2>A.</h2><p text-align:justify>After booking, you can send a message to the Cinnamon Maker through the CONTACT button located in your experience details in your profile. If you don’t want to contact the Cinnamon Maker, that’s fine, simply show up on the date and time provided in your experience datails and enjoy! </p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-sm-12">
                <h2>Q.</h2><p>I did not like the experience, can I get a refund?</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-sm-12" style="background-color:#ffa942">
                <h2>A.</h2><p text-align:justify>It is our top priority for you to have a memorable experience, please tell us about the experience so that we can serve you better, contact us at support@cinnamon.ph </p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-sm-12">
                <h2>Q.</h2><p>Should my child be accompanied by a parent or a guardian during the experience?</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-sm-12" style="background-color:#ffa942">
                <h2>A.</h2><p text-align:justify>Younger kids are encouraged to have a guardian or a parent to be with them. Some experience do not need a parent, but some is best experienced together. </p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-sm-12">
                <h2>Q.</h2><p>Something came up. I need to reschedule my child’s tutoring session. How do I do this?</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-sm-12" style="background-color:#ffa942">
                <h2>A.</h2><p text-align:justify>We got you covered, pls refer to our Change in Schedule Policy</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-sm-12">
                <h2>Q.</h2><p>I have an issue with the Cinnamon Maker’s behavior. What can I do?</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-sm-12" style="background-color:#ffa942">
                <h2>A.</h2><p text-align:justify>Cinnamon Makers follow a unique onboarding process that focuses on family experiences. If the experience is not satisfactory, kindly contact us immediately and we will conduct a fair investigation. If eligible, we will immediately issue a full refund and solve the identified issues.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-sm-12">
                <h2>Q.</h2><p>Who are the Cinnamon Makers?</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-sm-12" style="background-color:#ffa942">
                <h2>A.</h2><p text-align:justify>Cinnamon Makers are passionate individuals who want to share their skills and learnings to the next generation and to people who just want to learn. Our unique onboarding aligns our Cinnamon Makers to our main goal and that is to connect you and your loved ones to experiences that matter and create value. </p>
            </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
<div class="container">
    <div class="footer">
        <div class="footer-content">
            <span class="footer-appname color-primary">@Resources.App.appName</span>
            <br /><br />
            <span class="footer-text">2022 Cinnamon.Inc &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href="#">Contact Us</a> &nbsp;&nbsp; Experiences listed are samples only</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</html>
@code {

}
